with Thorne's Daily Electrolytes."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Scientifically formulated with zero sugar and no artificial colors, Daily Electrolytes helps you stay hydrated and optimizes your energy level in 3 ways:"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Scientifically formulated with zero sugar and no artificial colors, Daily Electrolytes helps you stay hydrated and optimizes your energy level in 3 ways:\r\nReplenish -  When you sweat, you lose micronutrients that fuel your muscles and brain. Daily Electrolytes restores the balance to promote endurance and athletic performance.\r\nRehydrate - When water alone isn't enough, Daily Electrolytes delivers the nutrients you need to support cellular hydration throughout the body.\r\nRecover - Featuring an optimal ratio of magnesium, potassium, and sodium, Daily Electrolytes helps your muscles repair and rebuild after exercise."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"This statement has not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Mix 1 stick pack with at least 12 ounces of water daily or as recommended by your health-care practitioner."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Tamper Evident: Use only if bag is sealed."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store sealed in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"If pregnant, consult your health-care practitioner before using this product."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"NSF Certified Sport\r\nManufactured in the USA using US & Imported Ingredients"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Gluten free"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"